gth additivity along the cell. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.tj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.tj","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L91-L91","doc":"Step map of the second generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.ti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.ti","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L89-L89","doc":"Step map of the first generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.len0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.len0","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L87-L87","doc":"The length of the minimal coset representative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.len","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.len","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L85-L85","doc":"The global length. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.equiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.equiv","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L83-L83","doc":"The parabolic factorization `W ≃ C × (ℤ₂×ℤ₂ cell)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.C","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L81-L81","doc":"The coset space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure.mk","kind":"ctor","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.CommutingCosetStructure","kind":"structure","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L75-L97","doc":"**Commuting (order-2 pair) coset structure**: the parabolic\nfactorization datum for a non-adjacent generator pair. `W` factors as\n`C × Fin 4` (coset space × the ℤ₂×ℤ₂ cell), lengths are additive along\nthe cell, and the two step maps act cell-wise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.cell_far_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.cell_far_commute","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L64-L71","doc":"**Far commutation on the cell** — the finite check that anchors the\nreduction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentC2σj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentC2σj","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L56-L62","doc":"Descent structure of the second generator on the cell\n(step pairs `0↔2, 1↔3`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentC2σi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentC2σi","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeCommutingCellReduction.lean#L48-L54","doc":"Descent structure of the first generator on the ℤ₂×ℤ₂ cell\n`[e, sᵢ, sⱼ, sᵢsⱼ]` (step pairs `0↔1, 2↔3`; lengths `[0,1,1,2]`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}